{"id":"ccdb3aca529813a9","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-large-ultrapower-by-measure.md","title":"ZFC Large Ultrapower By Measure","display":"df-zfc-large-ultrapower-by-measure — ZFC Large Ultrapower By Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-large-ultrapower-by-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-large-ultrapower-by-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-large-ultrapower-by-measure — ZFC Large Ultrapower By Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-large-ultrapower-by-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-large-ultrapower-by-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-large-ultrapower-by-measure — ZFC Large Ultrapower By Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"80d22bbd3f726e33\" href=\"?note=80d22bbd3f726e33\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md\">../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f20a389e87b9d76\" href=\"?note=9f20a389e87b9d76\" title=\"58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter.md\">58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\kappa,U\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\kappa,U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=\\langle A,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal M=\\langle A,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N=\\langle A^\\kappa/U,J_C,J_F,J_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal N=\\langle A^\\kappa/U,J_C,J_F,J_R\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S\\)</span> (see the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f]_U\">\\([f]_U\\)</span> (the equivalence class defined by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"80d22bbd3f726e33\" href=\"?note=80d22bbd3f726e33\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md\">../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargeUltrapowerByMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargeUltrapowerByMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li>下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[i\\mapsto t(i)]_U\\coloneqq[\\{\\langle i,t(i)\\rangle:i\\in\\kappa\\}]_U\">\\([i\\mapsto t(i)]_U\\coloneqq[\\{\\langle i,t(i)\\rangle:i\\in\\kappa\\}]_U\\)</span>；解释函数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 个参数编码为定义域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的函数图。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}large\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}by\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargeUltrapowerByMeasure}_S\n(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,U)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar},A,I_C,I_F,I_R,J_C,J_F,J_R\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathcal M=\\langle A,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\n\\land A\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_C,C,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_F,F,\\operatorname{ran}(I_F))\n\\land\\forall s\\in F\\;\n\\mathrm{Function}(I_F(s),A^{\\operatorname{ar}(s)},A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_R,R,\\operatorname{ran}(I_R))\n\\land\\forall Q\\in R\\;I_R(Q)\\subseteq A^{\\operatorname{ar}(Q)}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S(\\kappa,U)\n\\land\\mathcal N=\\langle A^\\kappa/U,J_C,J_F,J_R\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land J_C=\n\\{\\langle c,[i\\mapsto I_C(c)]_U\\rangle:c\\in C\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J_C,C,A^\\kappa/U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J_F,F,\\operatorname{ran}(J_F))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall r\\in\\omega\\;\\forall s\\in F\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(s)=r\\to\n\\mathrm{Function}(J_F(s),(A^\\kappa/U)^r,A^\\kappa/U)\\land\n\\forall\\vec f\\in(A^\\kappa)^r\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\nJ_F(s)(\\{\\langle k,[\\vec f(k)]_U\\rangle:k\\in r\\})\n=\n[i\\mapsto I_F(s)(\\{\\langle k,\\vec f(k)(i)\\rangle:k\\in r\\})]_U\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J_R,R,\\operatorname{ran}(J_R))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall r\\in\\omega\\;\\forall Q\\in R\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(Q)=r\\to\nJ_R(Q)\\subseteq(A^\\kappa/U)^r\\land\n\\forall\\vec f\\in(A^\\kappa)^r\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\n\\bigl[\n\\{\\langle k,[\\vec f(k)]_U\\rangle:k\\in r\\}\\in J_R(Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\leftrightarrow\n\\{i\\in\\kappa:\n\\{\\langle k,\\vec f(k)(i)\\rangle:k\\in r\\}\\in I_R(Q)\\}\\in U\n\\bigr]\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}large\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}by\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargeUltrapowerByMeasure}_S\n(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,U)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar},A,I_C,I_F,I_R,J_C,J_F,J_R\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathcal M=\\langle A,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\n\\land A\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_C,C,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_F,F,\\operatorname{ran}(I_F))\n\\land\\forall s\\in F\\;\n\\mathrm{Function}(I_F(s),A^{\\operatorname{ar}(s)},A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_R,R,\\operatorname{ran}(I_R))\n\\land\\forall Q\\in R\\;I_R(Q)\\subseteq A^{\\operatorname{ar}(Q)}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S(\\kappa,U)\n\\land\\mathcal N=\\langle A^\\kappa/U,J_C,J_F,J_R\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land J_C=\n\\{\\langle c,[i\\mapsto I_C(c)]_U\\rangle:c\\in C\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J_C,C,A^\\kappa/U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J_F,F,\\operatorname{ran}(J_F))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall r\\in\\omega\\;\\forall s\\in F\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(s)=r\\to\n\\mathrm{Function}(J_F(s),(A^\\kappa/U)^r,A^\\kappa/U)\\land\n\\forall\\vec f\\in(A^\\kappa)^r\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\nJ_F(s)(\\{\\langle k,[\\vec f(k)]_U\\rangle:k\\in r\\})\n=\n[i\\mapsto I_F(s)(\\{\\langle k,\\vec f(k)(i)\\rangle:k\\in r\\})]_U\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J_R,R,\\operatorname{ran}(J_R))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall r\\in\\omega\\;\\forall Q\\in R\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(Q)=r\\to\nJ_R(Q)\\subseteq(A^\\kappa/U)^r\\land\n\\forall\\vec f\\in(A^\\kappa)^r\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\n\\bigl[\n\\{\\langle k,[\\vec f(k)]_U\\rangle:k\\in r\\}\\in J_R(Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\leftrightarrow\n\\{i\\in\\kappa:\n\\{\\langle k,\\vec f(k)(i)\\rangle:k\\in r\\}\\in I_R(Q)\\}\\in U\n\\bigr]\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both structures are explicit four-tuples, so the quotient universe is not confused with the full ultrapower structure.</li>\n<li>The function and relation clauses are independent of representatives by equality modulo <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>; this is the well-definedness part of the usual Łoś construction.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md","status":"resolved","id":"80d22bbd3f726e33","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f20a389e87b9d76","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md","status":"resolved","id":"80d22bbd3f726e33","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[f]_U$ (the equivalence class defined by [[../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\kappa,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M=\\langle A,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N=\\langle A^\\kappa/U,J_C,J_F,J_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"[f]_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargeUltrapowerByMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"[i\\mapsto t(i)]_U\\coloneqq[\\{\\langle i,t(i)\\rangle:i\\in\\kappa\\}]_U","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}large\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}by\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargeUltrapowerByMeasure}_S\n(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,U)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar},A,I_C,I_F,I_R,J_C,J_F,J_R\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathcal M=\\langle A,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\n\\land A\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_C,C,A)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_F,F,\\operatorname{ran}(I_F))\n\\land\\forall s\\in F\\;\n\\mathrm{Function}(I_F(s),A^{\\operatorname{ar}(s)},A)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_R,R,\\operatorname{ran}(I_R))\n\\land\\forall Q\\in R\\;I_R(Q)\\subseteq A^{\\operatorname{ar}(Q)}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S(\\kappa,U)\n\\land\\mathcal N=\\langle A^\\kappa/U,J_C,J_F,J_R\\rangle\\\\\n&\\quad\\land J_C=\n\\{\\langle c,[i\\mapsto I_C(c)]_U\\rangle:c\\in C\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J_C,C,A^\\kappa/U)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J_F,F,\\operatorname{ran}(J_F))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall r\\in\\omega\\;\\forall s\\in F\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(s)=r\\to\n\\mathrm{Function}(J_F(s),(A^\\kappa/U)^r,A^\\kappa/U)\\land\n\\forall\\vec f\\in(A^\\kappa)^r\\;\\\\\n&\\hspace{18mm}\nJ_F(s)(\\{\\langle k,[\\vec f(k)]_U\\rangle:k\\in r\\})\n=\n[i\\mapsto I_F(s)(\\{\\langle k,\\vec f(k)(i)\\rangle:k\\in r\\})]_U\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J_R,R,\\operatorname{ran}(J_R))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall r\\in\\omega\\;\\forall Q\\in R\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(Q)=r\\to\nJ_R(Q)\\subseteq(A^\\kappa/U)^r\\land\n\\forall\\vec f\\in(A^\\kappa)^r\\;\\\\\n&\\hspace{18mm}\n\\bigl[\n\\{\\langle k,[\\vec f(k)]_U\\rangle:k\\in r\\}\\in J_R(Q)\\\\\n&\\hspace{34mm}\\leftrightarrow\n\\{i\\in\\kappa:\n\\{\\langle k,\\vec f(k)(i)\\rangle:k\\in r\\}\\in I_R(Q)\\}\\in U\n\\bigr]\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":3305,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2412","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-large-ultrapower-by-measure.md|58-df-zfc-large-ultrapower-by-measure]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3888033a846b1cd5","36d7463d215be751","80d22bbd3f726e33","9f20a389e87b9d76"]}